  "description": "<div class=\"block description\">This 35L hiking pack offers the perfect balance of capacity and comfort at just 970 g. Designed for day hikes and overnight adventures, it provides ample space for gear without adding unnecessary bulk. The lightweight construction makes it easy to carry, while durable materials and a streamlined design ensure reliability on the trail.</div>\n<div class=\"block features\">\n<br>\n<ul>\n<li>YKK Zips</li>\n<li>Stretch front pouch and dual side mesh pockets</li>\n<li>Hydration bladder compatible</li>\n<li>Zippered lumbar strap pockets for small essentials</li>\n<li>Lightweight, abrasion-resistant ripstop nylon</li>\n<li>FAB199</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
